From e95722aca96512c74f9413aedc9f4d64f9e947b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:45:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): approval gate cards that Allow/Deny paused
 ask-classified tool calls

Surface approval.required telemetry as pending approval cards in the
Telemetry view and the live terminal: tool, risk level, redacted command
and classifier reason, with Allow/Deny buttons that POST
/api/runtime/approvals/{id}. Resolved (approved/denied/expired) approvals
disappear via the approval.resolved stream event; decisions hide
optimistically and are restored if the API rejects them.
